  "generated_text": "First, we need to compute the expression inside the square root:\n\n\\[(311330)()()(22)) \n\nNext, we calculate the product step by step:\n\n\\[.31 \\times 30 = 29 00\n\n\n\n\\[\n2900 \\times 29 = 84 000\n\n\n\n\n\n800000 \n\n\n\n\\[\n840000 \\times 28 = 2000000\n\n\n\n\n\n2000000\n\n\n\n\\[\n2000000 + 1 = 2000000\n\n\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt{2000001} = \n\n00\n\n\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt{2000001} = \n\n00\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n000\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\boxed{000}",
